  "content_raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<!-- content-architecture-2026:services -->\n<style>\n.kk-services-2026 {\n  --kk-ink: #171310;\n  --kk-ink-soft: rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.78);\n  --kk-muted: rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.55);\n  --kk-line: rgba(23, 19, 16, 0.14);\n  --kk-card: #e6dcc2;\n  --kk-paper: #efe6d2;\n  --kk-accent: #d94a1f;\n  --kk-accent-text: #b53c18;\n  color: var(--kk-ink-soft);\n  max-width: 72rem;\n}\n.kk-services-2026 :where(p, li)::first-letter {\n  initial-letter: normal !important;\n  font-size: inherit !important;\n  font-weight: inherit !important;\n  float: none !important;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n  line-height: inherit !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: transparent !important;\n}\n.kk-services-2026 a:not(.kk-services-button) {\n  color: var(--kk-accent-text);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n.kk-services-2026 a:not(.kk-services-button):hover {\n  color: var(--kk-ink);\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  text-underline-offset: 3px;\n}\n.kk-services-hero,\n.kk-services-section {\n  padding: 0 0 2.4rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--kk-line);\n  margin-bottom: 2.4rem;\n}\n.kk-services-section:last-child {\n  border-bottom: 0;\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n  padding-bottom: 0;\n}\n.kk-services-kicker {\n  margin: 0 0 0.55rem;\n  font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace;\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.28em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--kk-accent-text);\n}\n.kk-services-display {\n  margin: 0.2rem 0 0.9rem;\n  font-family: \"Space Grotesk\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);\n  line-height: 0.98;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--kk-ink);\n  max-width: 18ch;\n}\n.kk-services-lead {\n  margin: 0 0 1rem;\n  font-size: 1.12rem;\n  line-height: 1.62;\n  max-width: 48rem;\n  color: var(--kk-ink-soft);\n}\n.kk-services-ribbon-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  gap: 1.75rem;\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n}\n@media (min-width: 800px) {\n  .kk-services-ribbon-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 2rem;\n  }\n}\n.kk-services-ribbon-card {\n  position: relative;\n  padding: 0.15rem 0 0.15rem 1.5rem;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 0;\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n.kk-services-ribbon-card::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 8px;\n  background: var(--service-ribbon, var(--kk-accent));\n}\n.kk-services-ribbon-card h3 {\n  margin: 0.35rem 0 0.65rem;\n  font-family: \"Space Grotesk\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.65rem;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  color: var(--kk-ink);\n}\n.kk-services-ribbon-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: var(--kk-ink-soft);\n}\n.kk-services-proof-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n}\n@media (min-width: 800px) {\n  .kk-services-proof-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  }\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card {\n  display: block;\n  border: 1px solid var(--kk-line);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--kk-card);\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  color: inherit;\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(181, 60, 24, 0.4);\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card img {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card > div {\n  padding: 1rem 1.1rem 1.15rem;\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card h3 {\n  margin: 0 0 0.4rem;\n  font-family: \"Space Grotesk\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  color: var(--kk-ink);\n}\n.kk-services-proof-card p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--kk-ink-soft);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.kk-services-cta {\n  border-top: 2px solid var(--kk-accent);\n  padding-top: 1.25rem;\n  max-width: 40rem;\n}\n.kk-services-cta h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 0.7rem;\n  font-family: \"Space Grotesk\", system-ui, sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  color: var(--kk-ink);\n}\n.kk-services-cta p {\n  margin: 0 0 1.1rem;\n  color: var(--kk-ink-soft);\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.kk-services-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--kk-ink);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  background: var(--kk-ink);\n  color: var(--kk-paper) !important;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n.kk-services-button:hover {\n  background: var(--kk-accent);\n  border-color: var(--kk-accent);\n  color: var(--kk-paper) !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"kk-page kk-services-2026\">\n  <section class=\"kk-services-hero\">\n    <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">AI services</p>\n    <h2 class=\"kk-services-display\">AI strategy for people who still care about culture.</h2>\n    <p class=\"kk-services-lead\">I help organizations, creative teams, schools, civic groups, and community builders move from AI pressure to practical fluency. The work is part strategy, part training, part sensemaking, and part creative courage.</p>\n    <p class=\"kk-services-lead\">This is not generic prompt-hacking. It is hands-on capacity building for people who need to use new tools without surrendering judgment, taste, responsibility, or trust.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"kk-services-section\">\n    <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">How I can help</p>\n    <div class=\"kk-services-ribbon-grid\">\n      <article class=\"kk-services-ribbon-card\" style=\"--service-ribbon:linear-gradient(180deg,#d94a1f 0 25%,#e8b53a 25% 50%,#1f8a86 50% 75%,#2b57a6 75% 100%)\">\n        <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">I.</p>\n        <h3>AI strategy</h3>\n        <p>Map where AI can actually help, where it should stay out, and how your team can move without chaos or vendor fog.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"kk-services-ribbon-card\" style=\"--service-ribbon:linear-gradient(180deg,#1f8a86 0 25%,#39a8d8 25% 50%,#6b3a97 50% 75%,#171310 75% 100%)\">\n        <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">II.</p>\n        <h3>Training and workshops</h3>\n        <p>Build practical AI fluency through live demos, workflow labs, and exercises people can use the next day.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"kk-services-ribbon-card\" style=\"--service-ribbon:linear-gradient(180deg,#e8b53a 0 25%,#d94a1f 25% 50%,#171310 50% 75%,#d6337a 75% 100%)\">\n        <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">III.</p>\n        <h3>Community systems</h3>\n        <p>Design the rooms, rituals, publishing loops, and lightweight infrastructure that help ecosystems learn in public.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"kk-services-ribbon-card\" style=\"--service-ribbon:linear-gradient(180deg,#171310 0 25%,#d94a1f 25% 50%,#e8b53a 50% 75%,#2b57a6 75% 100%)\">\n        <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">IV.</p>\n        <h3>Keynotes and briefings</h3>\n        <p>Give your audience a useful, human, slightly electric way to understand what AI means for their work.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"kk-services-section\">\n    <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">Proof in motion</p>\n    <div class=\"kk-services-proof-grid\">\n      <a class=\"kk-services-proof-card\" href=\"/work/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/bc-ai.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bcai-living-ecosystem.webp?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"BC plus AI ecosystem network graphic\" width=\"1200\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>BC + AI Ecosystem</h3>\n          <p>Grassroots AI community infrastructure for builders, artists, educators, researchers, and policy people across British Columbia.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"kk-services-proof-card\" href=\"/speaking/\">\n        <img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/kriskrug.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/kk-laSalle-both-hands-full-25-scaled.jpg?w=1200&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Kris Krug speaking on stage about creativity and AI\" width=\"1200\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"/>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Creative AI keynotes</h3>\n          <p>Talks and workshops that make complicated technology feel usable without sanding off the weird human parts.</p>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"kk-services-section\">\n    <p class=\"kk-services-kicker\">Start here</p>\n    <div class=\"kk-services-cta\">\n      <h2>Book an AI strategy session</h2>\n      <p>Bring me the room, the audience, the workflow, or the messy question. I will help you find the useful edge and turn it into a plan people can actually act on.</p>\n      <p><a class=\"kk-services-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a conversation</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n"
